{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"1770796","self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1770796","key":"WT-7653","fields":{"customfield_14270":null,"customfield_20550":null,"customfield_23823":null,"customfield_20153":null,"customfield_14275":null,"customfield_16452":null,"customfield_14272":null,"customfield_14278":null,"fixVersions":[],"resolution":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/resolution/13203","id":"13203","description":"Person who logged the issue is no longer responding. In SERVER, used for bugs that are no longer present in a newer version of the product","name":"Gone away"},"customfield_18358":null,"customfield_18359":null,"customfield_26661":null,"customfield_24367":null,"customfield_23676":null,"customfield_21753":null,"customfield_25856":null,"customfield_25857":null,"lastViewed":null,"customfield_19950":null,"customfield_25858":null,"customfield_19951":null,"customfield_18063":null,"customfield_19152":null,"customfield_20384":null,"customfield_19153":null,"customfield_14261":null,"customfield_13450":null,"customfield_14262":null,"customfield_11151":"Wed Apr 17 02:48:20 UTC 2024","customfield_14267":null,"customfield_13850":null,"priority":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://jira.mongodb.org/images/icons/priorities/major.svg","name":"Major - P3","id":"3"},"labels":["bug-classification-activity-phase-2","group-d"],"customfield_25181":"<a href='https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/WT-7653'>WT-7653 - Inconsistent update performance on unique indexes</a><br><strong>Status:</strong> Closed<br><strong>Assigned Teams:</strong> [Storage Engines]<br><strong>Assignee:</strong> Chenhao Qu<br><br><strong>Last Comment:</strong> Chenhao Qu - Over 31 months ago<br>I reran the reproducer on the latest master code. The performance gap has disappeared.\r\n\r\n\r\n{code:java}\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] starting bulk load on nonUnique\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] inserted 10000\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] bulk load on nonUnique: 167ms\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] starting update on nonUnique\r\n.....\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] update on nonUnique: 420ms\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] starting bulk load on unique\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] inserted 10000\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] bulk load on unique: 211ms\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] starting update on unique\r\n.....\r\n[js_test:SERVER-56509] update on unique: 484ms\r\n{code}\r\n\r\nI think the performance improvement mainly can be attributed to MongoDB moving away from using search_near on unique indexes. Instead, we now use a single next or prev call on the bounded cursor to locate to the correct key, which is much more efficient. Close this ticket as the gap has gone away.<br>","customfield_10855":null,"customfield_26153":null,"timeestimate":null,"aggregatetimeoriginalestimate":null,"customfield_10857":null,"versions":[{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/version/21935","id":"21935","name":"4.2.0","archived":false,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2019-08-09"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/version/26691","id":"26691","description":"","name":"4.4.0","archived":false,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2020-07-25"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/version/31293","id":"31293","description":"","name":"5.0.0-rc0","archived":false,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2021-05-27"}],"customfield_24250":null,"issuelinks":[{"id":"1021327","self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issueLink/1021327","outwardIssue":{"id":"1638732","key":"WT-7264","self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1638732","fields":{"summary":"Creating a new configuration for search near that allows it to exit quickly when searching for prefixes","status":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/status/6","description":"The issue is considered finished, the resolution is correct. Issues which are closed can be reopened.","iconUrl":"https://jira.mongodb.org/images/icons/statuses/closed.png","name":"Closed","id":"6","statusCategory":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"success","name":"Done"}},"priority":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://jira.mongodb.org/images/icons/priorities/major.svg","name":"Major - P3","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issuetype/1","id":"1","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product.","iconUrl":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=14703&avatarType=issuetype","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":14703}}},"type":{"id":"10012","name":"Related","inward":"is related to","outward":"related to","self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10012"}},{"id":"1021326","self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issueLink/1021326","inwardIssue":{"id":"1696512","key":"SERVER-56509","self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512","fields":{"summary":"Wrap unique index insertion _keyExists call in a WT cursor reconfigure.","status":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/status/6","description":"The issue is considered finished, the resolution is correct. Issues which are closed can be reopened.","iconUrl":"https://jira.mongodb.org/images/icons/statuses/closed.png","name":"Closed","id":"6","statusCategory":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"success","name":"Done"}},"priority":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://jira.mongodb.org/images/icons/priorities/major.svg","name":"Major - P3","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issuetype/4","id":"4","description":"An improvement or enhancement to an existing feature or task.","iconUrl":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=14710&avatarType=issuetype","name":"Improvement","subtask":false,"avatarId":14710}}},"type":{"id"